  "schema:description": "The dataset presents a chapter of the Digital Catalogue of Biodiversity of Poland, comprising taxa of (infra)specific level, reported from Poland in the present administrative boundaries of the country. In this instance of the Catalogue, the list includes only taxa of confirmed occurrence, ignoring doubtful records that need verification as well as synonyms and other not valid names. The occurrence of each species is supported by a published reference.\n\nProject: Grant of the Polish Ministry of Education & Science\n\nProject abstract: The Digital Catalogue of Biodiversity of Poland Project was supported by the Ministry of Education & Science as an extension of GBIF cooperation funds for 2017-2021. The scope covered all eukaryotic taxa of the country plus Cyanobacteria.",
